; SHIMMERING VEIL, the core system (design 1.4): three actions, each in its own usage group. The
; protocol SALVATION UPON THE WICKED (consumes_cp) hangs buff_salvation; action_salvation_relock is
; its hidden statuses_changed reaction, live only while the chip is; THE BLOOD OF THE CREATURE... is
; the passive's attack POST reaction and IS the card's passive line. The Kit's `.effect` row is that
; passive line; the active has its own rows. Exactly two glyph families at SP5: SALVATION (the
; protocol, the chip, the relock) and THE BLOOD (the passive's reaction). No icon yet.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("2_action")]([ExtResource("3_salvation"), ExtResource("4_relock"), ExtResource("5_blood")])
is_trait = true
